This repo assembles upstream components that carry their own licenses and does not
relicense them: vLLM (Apache 2.0), intel/llm-scaler and intel/omix (see Intel's
image terms), the Qwen3.8 checkpoints (see the model card), and the DSpark drafter
(Apache 2.0).

No model weights are committed here. The repo pins Hugging Face repo ids, commit
hashes, and one sha256 for the drafter tensor file. Check the model cards before
re-hosting weights or redistributing outputs.
